          "title": "You'll want to know: la giustizia",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la giustizia — \"the justice\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Le vittime chiedono giustizia. The victims are asking for justice."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Fare giustizia — to see justice done."
            }
          ]
